{"story":{"name":"Ecosystem","created_at":"2025-12-18T21:09:21.885Z","published_at":"2026-05-07T16:58:11.806Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T16:58:11.829Z","id":124528893511428,"uuid":"2e57b196-3863-42eb-a200-4b3aba6e7162","content":{"_uid":"e9f41c51-0fbc-4458-ba5d-669817151a5f","body":[{"_uid":"0b584149-a1c1-4e0f-a468-9ae322f11ffe","visible":true,"cta_link":{"id":"2e57b196-3863-42eb-a200-4b3aba6e7162","url":"","linktype":"story","fieldtype":"multilink","cached_url":"ecosystem"},"cta_text":"Zu den Partnern","headline":"Das Ökosystem für Innovation","component":"main-hero","cta_anchor":"partners-glossary","hero_image":{"id":136850477713430,"alt":"","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/288104308443570/4176x1488/c22270bcb9/hero-section-desktop.webp","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{},"is_external_url":false},"description":"Wo Startups, Industrie und Forschung zusammenkommen – um Ideen Wirklichkeit werden zu lassen.\u2028LOVEDIS ist das Innovationsökosystem Mittelhessens: ein Netzwerk aus Unternehmen, Hochschulen, Investor:innen und Institutionen, die gemeinsam Zukunft gestalten.","hero_image_fit":"cover","hero_image_mask":"rounded-bl-80","hero_image_zoom":"100","disable_animation":true,"fill_transparency":true,"hero_image_mobile":{"id":136850477733912,"alt":"","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/288104308443570/1074x1488/8775a15a1c/hero-mobile.webp","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{},"is_external_url":false},"hero_image_tablet":{"id":136850477721623,"alt":"","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/288104308443570/2358x2238/68edb35299/hero-tablet.webp","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{},"is_external_url":false},"hero_image_mask_bg":"","hero_image_quality":"","hero_image_position":"center","hero_image_mask_tablet":"","transparency_fill_color":"ups-orange","hero_image_mask_bg_mobile":"","hero_image_mask_bg_tablet":"","hero_image_mask_position_x":"50","hero_image_mask_position_y":"50","hero_image_mask_position_x_mobile":"","hero_image_mask_position_x_tablet":"","hero_image_mask_position_y_mobile":""},{"alt":"","_uid":"94169023-2a8e-471b-9d9a-f357ca0379f4","cards":[{"_uid":"ecosystem-card-1768294871821-0","title":"Starke Industrie- und Technologiepartner","mask_fit":"contain","component":"ecosystem-card","mask_image":{"id":135825215927614,"alt":"","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/288104308443570/462x480/6cebb33c5e/bento-box-desktop.svg","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{},"is_external_url":false},"description":"Wir bringen Startups direkt mit den Marktführern der Region zusammen. So wird aus einer Technologie-Idee ein Pilotprojekt im Betrieb. Unsere Partner öffnen ihre Türen für Praxistests, teilen ihr Branchenwissen und werden für Startups zum ersten großen Kunden und öffnen Zugänge in den Markt.","mask_position":"","background_color":"#FF5736","decoration_color":"#FFDBF5"},{"_uid":"ecosystem-card-1768294871821-1","title":"Spitzenforschung \u0026 Ausgründungen","mask_fit":"contain","component":"ecosystem-card","mask_image":{"id":135825215939903,"alt":"","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/288104308443570/462x480/3081534acb/bento-box-desktop-1.svg","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{},"is_external_url":false},"description":"Mittelhessen ist ein Kraftzentrum für Hochschulen und Forschung. Wir sorgen dafür, dass kluge Köpfe nicht in der Theorie bleiben, sondern den Schritt ins eigene Business wagen. Wir begleiten gezielte Ausgründungen aus den Universitäten und bringen Startups mit Expert:innen und Talenten zusammen, damit aus Labordaten echte, skalierbare Produkte werden.","mask_position":"","background_color":"#2926E5","decoration_color":"#E0EDFF"},{"_uid":"ecosystem-card-1768294871821-2","title":"Gründer:innen \u0026 Innovations-Netzwerk","mask_fit":"contain","component":"ecosystem-card","mask_image":{"id":135825215915324,"alt":"","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/288104308443570/462x480/cf0b7ae32a/bento-box-desktop-2.svg","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{},"is_external_url":false},"description":"Ein Startup wächst nicht im Vakuum. Wir vernetzen euch mit den entscheidenden Köpfen der regionalen Wirtschaft – von erfahrenen Mentor:innen und spezialisierten Expert:innen bis hin zu den Teams hinter den anderen Innovationszentren der Region. Alle Kontakte, die es braucht, um schneller von der Idee in den Markt zu kommen.","mask_position":"","background_color":"#00B97E","decoration_color":"#C0FCD8"},{"_uid":"ecosystem-card-1768294871821-3","title":"Zugang zu Investor:innen","mask_fit":"contain","component":"ecosystem-card","mask_image":{"id":135825215915325,"alt":"","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/288104308443570/462x480/b000532eba/bento-box-desktop-3.svg","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{},"is_external_url":false},"description":"Wir bringen euch frühzeitig mit den passenden Investor:innen zusammen. Unser Netzwerk umfasst erfahrene Business Angels, Family Offices und VCs. Durch Partner wie Wunderland Capital erhaltet ihr zudem Zugang zu einem europaweiten Netzwerk führender Venture Capital Fonds. So sichert ihr euch nicht nur Kapital, sondern auch die strategische Reichweite und das Branchen-Wissen, das für echtes Wachstum nötig ist.","mask_position":"","background_color":"#2926E5","decoration_color":""}],"image":{"id":143210507270472,"alt":"","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/288104308443570/2715x2196/09d16ba133/deskptop.png","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{},"is_external_url":false},"tagline":"Ökosystem im Überblick","visible":true,"headline":"Forschung trifft Wirtschaft","component":"ecosystem-section","image_fit":"contain","section_id":"","text_color":"","description":"","image_mobile":{"id":143210507262278,"alt":"","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/288104308443570/1074x1605/58874218fd/mobile.png","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{},"is_external_url":false},"image_tablet":{"id":143210507262279,"alt":"","name":"","focus":"","title":"","source":"","filename":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/288104308443570/2358x2136/df0e365402/tablet.png","copyright":"","fieldtype":"asset","meta_data":{},"is_external_url":false},"description_2":"","image_quality":"","image_position":"right","image_background_color":"ups-pink"},{"_uid":"ae00533e-516f-45cc-8a48-b76bff0a8064","tiers":[{"_uid":"55229beb-8fa2-42ee-a74d-d36bcc52a8fa","visible":true,"partners":[{"_uid":"ece727c6-2b67-4744-a98c-c2efc59effab","partner":"bd35aa42-a10b-4f19-afa6-57d6cf70330a","visible":true,"component":"partner-reference","disable_popup":false},{"_uid":"13a83796-e681-43fa-83ce-75f3a2afdc9d","partner":"b8300252-2688-44e0-bece-48b1fc58094c","visible":true,"component":"partner-reference","disable_popup":false},{"_uid":"2222798b-43b1-4519-b450-0f022c2287e9","partner":"ecbd8df8-ba3a-42bf-b73f-ce4c8d09164d","visible":true,"component":"partner-reference","disable_popup":false},{"_uid":"49022a49-fe89-4bd8-ab54-5b06eeb4d474","partner":"41293a1e-2bc5-40e8-ac36-650a17c826ac","visible":true,"component":"partner-reference","disable_popup":false}],"component":"sponsor-tier-row","level_label":"Strategische Partner"},{"_uid":"e1b78b9e-5ccd-428e-8edc-de043fde4d90","visible":true,"partners":[{"_uid":"de0c96df-504c-47ef-b4b0-8fb7b7e1d994","partner":"d755dc82-4f1c-443e-8b62-e461b002307f","visible":true,"component":"partner-reference","disable_popup":false},{"_uid":"fd5d2fdb-f922-449f-b876-85faa092d7c2","partner":"b21cc198-4845-4772-8879-90e668c9b70a","visible":true,"component":"partner-reference","disable_popup":false},{"_uid":"78961406-3490-426e-9a00-0d32bb5a8668","partner":"7228618b-9d51-